72 760 Td (Tenacious Conversion Engine — Act V Memo) Tj
72 744 Td (Page 2/2 — The Skeptic’s Appendix) Tj
72 728 Td () Tj
72 712 Td (A\) Four failure modes τ²-Bench does not capture \(what / why τ² misses / what to add / cost\):) Tj
72 696 Td (1\) Wrong-signal outreach \(signal_overclaiming\):) Tj
72 680 Td (   What: agent asserts hiring/AI/funding claims from weak public signal.) Tj
72 664 Td (   Why τ² misses: τ² retail tasks do not exercise public-signal grounding for real companies.) Tj
72 648 Td (   Add: enforce confidence-tier phrasing + abstention when confidence < 0.6; add probe gates.) Tj
72 632 Td (   Cost: lower throughput; requires more enrichment checks per prospect.) Tj
72 616 Td (2\) Tone/brand offense \(offshore language triggers\):) Tj
72 600 Td (   What: phrasing that reads like low-quality outsourcing spam.) Tj
72 584 Td (   Why τ² misses: retail benchmark has no brand sensitivity or founder persona risk.) Tj
72 568 Td (   Add: style-guide rubric + red-flag phrase filters + human review for first 50 sends.) Tj
72 552 Td (   Cost: review time; false positives can reduce volume.) Tj
72 536 Td (3\) Booking proxy mismatch \(booking_created ≠ qualified\):) Tj
72 520 Td (   What: system can get replies but fail the booking proxy due to tooling mismatch.) Tj
72 504 Td (   Why τ² misses: τ² tasks are closed-form; no real calendar / sales workflow variance.) Tj
72 488 Td (   Add: align qualification to Tenacious CRM stages; instrument post-reply handoff.) Tj
72 472 Td (   Cost: HubSpot stage mapping + ops time.) Tj
72 456 Td (4\) Competitive-gap benchmark mismatch:) Tj
72 440 Td (   What: “top-quartile practice” may be irrelevant or strategically wrong for a prospect.) Tj
72 424 Td (   Why τ² misses: benchmark is not conditioned on sub-niche strategy constraints.) Tj
72 408 Td (   Add: ask a calibration question before prescribing; allow ‘deliberate choice’ escape hatch.) Tj
72 392 Td (   Cost: longer emails; slightly lower reply rates expected.) Tj
72 376 Td () Tj
72 360 Td (B\) Public-signal lossiness \(false negatives / false positives\):) Tj
72 344 Td (False negative: quietly sophisticated but silent company → scorer underestimates readiness → overly basic pitch → lost deal.) Tj
72 328 Td (False positive: loud but shallow company → scorer overestimates readiness → over-technical pitch → brand damage + lower replies.) Tj
72 312 Td () Tj
72 296 Td (C\) Gap-analysis risks \(when top-quartile is a bad benchmark\):) Tj
72 280 Td (Risk 1: deliberate strategy \(e.g., regulated workflow where ‘move fast’ practices are harmful\) → wrong recommendation harms trust.) Tj
72 264 Td (Risk 2: sub-niche irrelevance \(capability gap is not binding constraint\) → prospect ignores message and categorizes as spam.) Tj
72 248 Td () Tj
72 232 Td (D\) Brand-reputation comparison \(unit economics\):) Tj
72 216 Td (Assume 1,000 emails sent; if 5% contain a wrong signal, that's 50 wrong-signal emails.) Tj
72 200 Td (If each wrong-signal email has an expected reputation cost of $10k in pipeline suppression, expected brand cost = $500k.) Tj
72 184 Td (Compare to expected reply-rate lift in the 7–12% range \(vs 1–3% baseline\).) Tj
72 168 Td () Tj
72 152 Td (E\) One honest unresolved probe \(business impact if deployed anyway\):) Tj
72 136 Td (Probe: signal_overclaiming \(P-005\): assertive Segment 1 opener regardless of confidence \(measured trigger rate 9/9\).) Tj
72 120 Td (Impact: undermines the core ‘grounded research’ value prop; can revert reply rates to baseline and create viral brand risk.) Tj
72 104 Td () Tj
72 88 Td (F\) Kill switch clause \(metric / threshold / rollback condition\):) Tj
72 72 Td (Metric: wrong-signal rate on manually audited sample of first 100 sends.) Tj
72 56 Td (Threshold: pause if wrong-signal rate ≥ 5% or any single high-severity false claim triggers an executive complaint.) Tj
72 40 Td (Rollback: revert to generic pitch template + require human approval for signal-grounded claims until fixed.) Tj
ET
